  "shortDescription": "Siem Reap2天游览，含Angkor Wat Sunrise & Temple Exploration、Breakfast Near Srah Srong和Ta Prohm – Iconic Jungle Temple and Pass by Terrace of the Elephants。直接向Journey Cambodia订位，而非通过分销商。",
