  "shortDescription": "4小时的Chiang Mai游览，含Jeep / SUV及Chiang Mai Mountain Biking & Kayaks and Wat Thepnimit Nantharam。运营商：CHIANG MAI MOUNTAIN BIKING & KAYAKS，直接预订而非通过转售商预订。",
